    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωμαδ-όν</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from the shoulders</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάστιγι κ. ἤλασεν ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.352
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.500
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>on</i> or <i>hanging from the shoulders</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.679
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωρηθεὶς ἐνετῇσι κ. ἠλέκτροιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					50.529
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
